<title>THAILAND: Thailand's BST secures $142.34 mln loan.</title>
<headline>Thailand's BST secures $142.34 mln loan.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thailand's Bangkok Synthetics Co Ltd (BST) on Thursday signed a syndicated loan for $142.34 million to finance its factory construction.</p>
<p>The lead arrangers of the loan were Bangkok Bank Plc and Siam Commercial Bank Plc, BST said in a statement.</p>
<p>The new factory, which will produce raw material used in the production of synthetic rubber, is scheduled to be completed in 1998, the statement said.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
